    description: "Concept DOI for all HEARTLAND Protocol App versions"
abstract: >-
  Progressive Web Application operationalizing the HEARTLAND Protocol for
  primary care-led heart failure workflows in rural and resource-limited
  settings. Version 1.1.0 includes a public synthetic-data sandbox, an
  operational Daily Loop and patient brief, governed multi-organization
  workspaces, protected provider access, privacy-safe adoption telemetry,
  and reliability and interoperability safeguards. The software supports
  implementation and evaluation and does not replace clinical judgment.
keywords:
  - heart failure
  - rural health
  - implementation science
  - clinical workflow
